{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056660/extras/7e32910ba58cd07d8055091e2ce8d38e.avif?t=1757510230\" width=614 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056660/extras/ad26db0a94f054faaa8256ab308be87f.poster.avif?t=1757510230\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056660/extras/ad26db0a94f054faaa8256ab308be87f.webm?t=1757510230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056660/extras/ad26db0a94f054faaa8256ab308be87f.mp4?t=1757510230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a Demon Lord, who rules over and manages his Dungeon.<br>Listen to what Creatures have to say to you, then make a Yes or No decision. <br>Each decision can affect your Dungeon's stats (Minion Count, Minion Loyalty, Karma and/or Gold). <br>Will you succeed in growing your Dungeon, or will you make it fall? <br>The choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056660/extras/1d31e21cb58f07fd9095a77b19da76f5.avif?t=1757510230\" width=614 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056660/extras/1fd145806f78bd15be52d330e9fc5072.poster.avif?t=1757510230\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056660/extras/1fd145806f78bd15be52d330e9fc5072.webm?t=1757510230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v